    "Record before/preparation manifests and runner SHA. Preparation deadline starts with first export/copy and includes per-file verification. Exact projected input path set must match PR1 plus final15 plus fixed CSV. Asset/meta audit permits exactly the signed two missing metas before import. Do not write asset YAML/meta or invoke SaveAssets/APIUpdater/custom scripts.",
